(770773, 'Commis Chef - Mykonos', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kmyv3067107tv42zps1xvgjt/commis-chef', 'n/a', '2026-03-30', '2026-03-30 08:00:15', 'ROKA Restaurants', 'Commis Chef  As a Commis Chef at Roka, you’re passionate about delivering exceptional culinary experiences, and you’ll play a key role in crafting dishes that leave a lasting impression. With your energy, enthusiasm, and dedication to excellence, you’ll be part of a team that sets the standard for modern dining.  Roka is a collection of contemporary Japanese Robatayaki restaurants. Roka Mykonos offers diners a seasonal, sun-soaked escape, where vibrant dishes, inventive cocktails, and live DJs set the scene for unforgettable summer days and nights. ROKA embodies the spirit of coming together and sharing a collective dining experience, (RO) symbolises the atmosphere and (KA), the heat of fire from the Robata Main Duties Your key responsibilities will include: Ensure mise en place levels are maintained to guarantee smooth service, with a focus on quality, consistency, and impeccable presentation Embrace opportunities to learn and grow, gaining experience across various kitchen sections under the guidance of senior chefs Inspect incoming goods for quality and accuracy, ensuring proper storage practices and minimizing waste Prepare food products according to recipes, ensuring precision, care, and adherence to the highest preparation standards Conduct daily hygiene checks in storage areas and maintain clean, organized workstations in line with Roka’s high standards Follow Health & Safety and Food Safety regulations, ensuring a safe and compliant work environment at all times  What We Look For Our ideal candidate embodies our values and brings: A genuine love for culinary experiences & a passion for Japanese cuisine Proven experience as a commis chef in a luxury high-volume restaurant A natural team player who is at home working in sync with a large team Naturally friendly, customer-orient