(771690, 'Sales Associate for a Beachwear Boutique', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kn20xajts7m893tz6edcfxdf/sales-associate-for-a-beachwear-boutique', 'n/a', '2026-03-31', '2026-03-31 16:00:33', 'MYCONIAN COLLECTION', 'Tα ξενοδοχεία Myconian Kyma, a member of Design Hotels και Myconian Korali, Relais et Chateaux, αναζητούν για τη σεζόν 2026: Sales Associate for a Beachwear Boutique Myconian Collection Hotels & Resorts, is looking to recruit for season 2024 a passionate Boutique Salesperson  for one of our 5* hotels, based in Mykonos. We are looking for individuals who have a solid work ethic, concern for quality, cross cultural sensitivity and customer service orientation.  Key responsibilities Demonstrating a pleasant and positive professional image at all times. Providing attentive and personalized service, demonstrating anticipation in the fulfillment of the customer’s needs and requests. Providing tailored advice on outfits, colors, styles, and fabrics that will complement the client\'s preferences, style and body type, as well as the occasion they\'re dressing for Working towards sales maximization and profit for the company. Updating knowledge with current fashion trends and principles. Providing targeted recommendations and alternatives for clients. Requirements Minimum 1 year experience in a retail/sales or fashion related position, preferably in a 5 star Hotel’s Boutique or High-end Clothing Brand Excellent command of both Greek and English language  Customer service and problem solving orientation Excellent sense of Fashion trends  We offer: Competitive remuneration package Accommodation (provided with WIFI access) and meals  Dynamic, friendly and supportive working environment Continuous training Great opportunities for career development within the company', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
