(781887, 'Restaurant Supervisor - Athens', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kp8744pf927xh6sttjfj1r61/restaurant-supervisor---athens', 'n/a', '2026-04-15', '2026-04-15 16:01:45', 'PRIMA HOTELS GREECE', 'Total Hospitality, on behalf of our partner Prima Hotels, is actively recruiting for their properties in Athens. Restaurant Supervisor Total Hospitality is proud to present Prima Hotels, a renowned collection offering diverse experiences from the vibrant streets of bustling cities to the tranquil beauty of leisure destinations. Committed to delivering exceptional, personalized service for every guest, Prima Hotels is rooted in a deep respect for local culture and modern hospitality. Now expanding into Europe, with its first stop in Athens, Greece, Prima Hotels invites you to explore the unique blend of tradition, innovation, and warmth that defines our approach to hospitality. Position summary We are seeking a dedicated and experienced Restaurant Supervisor to support the management of our hotel\'s food and beverage operations in Athens, Greece. The ideal candidate will ensure excellent guest service, oversee daily restaurant operations, and assist in leading a team to deliver outstanding dining experiences. This role requires strong organizational skills, a keen eye for detail, and a passion for hospitality. Scope: Reports to the Restaurant Manager Supervise daily operations of the restaurant, ensuring smooth service and guest satisfaction Train, mentor, and lead restaurant staff, maintaining high standards of service and performance Monitor and manage staff schedules, ensuring proper coverage during peak and off-peak hours Ensure food safety, cleanliness, and compliance with health and sanitation regulations Assist in managing inventory, ordering supplies, and controlling costs Address guest concerns and resolve issues promptly to ensure satisfaction Assist the Restaurant Manager in developing and implementing strategies to increase revenue Contribute to the development of menu ideas and promotions Prerequisites: Bachelor’s degree in Hospitality Management, Culinary Arts, Business Administration, or a related field. Minimum of 3 years of experience in F&B management, preferably in a hotel or high-volume restaurant setting. Fluent in Greek and English; additional languages are an asset. Proficiency in F&B management software, POS systems, and MS Office Suite Position attributes: Strong leadership and communication skills with the ability to motivate and manage a team Excellent guest service skills, with a passion for creating memorable dining experiences Proactive problem-solving abilities with attention to detail Ability to work efficiently in a fast-paced environment Strong organizational and time management skills Ability to adapt to changing situations and remain calm under pressure Employee benefits:  Competitive remuneration package Continuous training Career prospects on a transparent working environment Collaborative working environment Elevate your hospitality career with Prima Hotels — where exciting opportunities await!', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(781888, 'Cook B', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kp86zr02wp8wgkcss7gs6bnb/cook-b', 'n/a', '2026-04-15', '2026-04-15 16:01:46', 'SWOT HOSPITALITY', 'H SWOT Hospitality Management Company αναζητά να προσλάβει για το ξενοδοχείο Samos Verde M Gallery by Accor, για τη σεζόν 2026: Cook B / Μάγειρας Β\' Καθήκοντα: Προετοιμασία και μαγείρεμα πιάτων ακολουθώντας τις συνταγές και τα πρότυπα ποιότητας Συνεργασία με την ομάδα της κουζίνας για την ομαλή λειτουργία της υπηρεσίας Διασφάλιση της καθαριότητας και της γενικής ευημερίας του περιβάλλοντος εργασίας Συμμετοχή στη διαχείριση αποθεμάτων και παραγγελιών υλικών Requirements: Προηγούμενη εμπειρία σε αντίστοιχη θέση Πτυχίο μαγειρικής σχολής ή αντίστοιχη εκπαίδευση Γνώσεις υγιεινής και ασφάλειας των τροφίμων Δεξιότητες ομαδικής εργασίας και αποτελεσματικής επικοινωνίας Επαγγελματική στάση και πάθος για την μαγειρική Benefits: Dynamic, friendly and supportive working environment Opportunities for career development within the company Continuous training and development Competitive compensation package Work with the best professionals in tourism industry why SWOT... Ανταγωνιστικό πακέτο αποδοχών Διαμονή Διατροφή', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
