(789973, 'Reservations Agent - Μύκονος', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kq77jyfxd59sb5yat0rhfkkj/reservations-agent---mykonos', 'n/a', '2026-04-27', '2026-04-27 16:01:31', 'MYCONIAN COLLECTION', 'O μεγαλύτερος ξενοδοχειακός όμιλος στη Μύκονο και τα πολυτελή ξενοδοχεία-μέλη του, (https://www.myconiancollection.gr/) Myconian Imperial Resort, member of the Leading Hotels of the World, Royal Myconian Resort, member of the Leading Hotels of the World, Myconian Villa Collection, member of Preferred Hotels & Resorts, Myconian Avaton Resort, member of Design Hotels, Myconian Utopia Resort, member of Relais & Chateaux, Myconian Ambassador, member of Relais & Chateaux, Panoptis Escape, member of Small Luxury Hotels of the World, Myconian O, by Myconian Collection, επιθυμούν να εντάξουν στην ομάδα τους: Reservations Agent Απαιτούμενα προσόντα: Προϋπηρεσία σε αντίστοιχη θέση σε πολυτελές ξενοδοχείο, κατά προτίμηση άνω των 100 δωματίων Πτυχίο τουριστικής σχολής Πολύ καλή γνώση της αγγλικής γλώσσας (προφορικώς και γραπτώς) Γνώση δεύτερης ξένης γλώσσας θα εκτιμηθεί ιδιαιτέρως. Απαραίτητη η γνώση ξενοδοχειακού προγράμματος PMS, κατά προτίμηση Protel Άριστη γνώση Η/Υ (Word, Excel, PowerPoint) Διαχείριση πλατφόρμας κρατήσεων WebHotelier, Booking, Expedia Ευχέρεια στην επικοινωνία Προσφέρονται: πλήρης διατροφή και διαμονή εντός των καταλυμάτων μας ευκαιρίες εξέλιξης και ανάπτυξης στον μεγαλύτερο ξενοδοχειακό όμιλο της Μυκόνου μισθός αναλόγως προσόντων ευκαιρία για 12μηνη απασχόληση', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
(789974, 'Assistant Waiters - Πάρος', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kq77pfy1zbmagpx6ey1mr7c7/assistant-waiters---paros', 'n/a', '2026-04-27', '2026-04-27 16:01:31', 'SWOT HOSPITALITY', 'Η SWOT Hospitality is seeking to recruit Assistant Waiters for the charming Vione Hotel Season 2026 Requirements Previous experience in a similar position within the hospitality industry Knowledge of food and beverage service standards Fluent in Greek and English Strong interpersonal and communication skills Ability to remain calm and efficient in a fast-paced environment Benefits Excellent working environment Continuous training and development Career development and opportunities Accommodation & meals SWOT Hospitality is a leading Hotel Management company, trusted by international investors, developers, and top-scale hospitality brands. SWOT Hospitality boasts extensive experience in management, investment and development, sales and marketing strategies, as well as advisory services, and is a valuable asset for businesses seeking guaranteed success. SWOT Hospitality is the white flag operator of international accommodation brands please visit .', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
(789975, 'Waiter/Waitress A & B - Μύκονος', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kq77jvwtyntynfsbjmqz0g1x/restaurant-waiter-waitress-a---b---mykonos', 'n/a', '2026-04-27', '2026-04-27 16:01:33', 'MYCONIAN COLLECTION', 'O μεγαλύτερος ξενοδοχειακός όμιλος στη Μύκονο και τα πολυτελή ξενοδοχεία-μέλη του ομίλου https://www.myconiancollection.gr/ Myconian Imperial Resort, member of the Leading Hotels of the World, Royal Myconian Resort, member of the Leading Hotels of the World, Myconian Villa Collection, member of Preferred Hotels & Resorts, Myconian Avaton Resort, member of Design Hotels, Myconian Utopia Resort, member of Relais & Chateaux, Myconian Ambassador, member of Relais & Chateaux, Panoptis Escape, member of Small Luxury Hotels of the World, Myconian O, by Myconian Collection επιθυμούν να εντάξουν στην ομάδα τους:  Waiter/Waitress A & B Η θέση αφορά εργασία στα εστιατόρια των ξενοδοχείων μας σε θέσεις: Dinner, a la carte Restaurants Breakfast Buffet Restaurants Pool Restaurants Sushi - Asian Cuisine Restaurants Απαιτούμενα προσόντα: Άριστη γνώση της αγγλικής, δεύτερη ξένη γλώσσα θα αξιολογηθεί θετικά. Προϋπηρεσία σε ξενοδοχείο 5 αστέρων Γενική γνώση κρασιών ελληνικού ή ξένου αμπελώνα Παρέχονται: Διαμονή εντός του ξενοδοχείου   Διατροφή (3 γεύματα) Ανταγωνιστικό πακέτο αποδοχών αναλόγως προσόντων Εκπαίδευση στους τρόπους λειτουργίας εστιατορίων των μεγαλύτερων ομίλων του κόσμου Δυνατότητα επαγγελματικής εξέλιξης', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
(789976, 'Μάγειρας / Cook  A-B- Μύκονος', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kq77jx5a02bsa4adg7yarjtb/mageiras-proinon---mykonos', 'n/a', '2026-04-27', '2026-04-27 16:01:33', 'MYCONIAN COLLECTION', 'Myconian Imperial Resort, member of Leading Hotels of the World, Royal Myconian Resort, member of Leading Hotels of the World, Myconian Villa Collection, member of Preferred Hotels & Resorts, Myconian Avaton Resort, member of Design Hotels, Myconian Utopia Resort, member of Relais & Chateaux, και Myconian Ambassador, member of Relais & Chateaux, all part of the Myconian Collection Hotels, a family-owned group of 5-star properties on Mykonos Island, are looking for passionate individuals to cover for the summer season of 2026 the position of: Μάγειρας /Cook  A-B Απαιτούμενα προσόντα – δεξιότητες: Ανάλογη προϋπηρεσία σε κουζίνα ξενοδοχείου Γνώση και εφαρμογή πολιτικών και διαδικασιών υγιεινής και ασφάλειας των τροφίμων Θετικός χαρακτήρας με θέληση για προσφορά, γνώση και σωστή καθοδήγηση της ομάδας Απόφοιτος σχολής μαγειρικής Η εταιρία μας προσφέρει: Συνεχή εκπαίδευση Ανταγωνιστικές μισθολογικές απολαβές αναλόγως προσόντων Ποιοτικές συνθήκες διαμονής και ημιδιατροφή Ευχάριστο περιβάλλον εργασίας', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
(789977, 'Hotel Restaurant Hostess', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kq77jtmrnh5fgd49f92jt98a/hotel-restaurant-hostess', 'n/a', '2026-04-27', '2026-04-27 16:01:35', 'MYCONIAN COLLECTION', 'Ο μεγαλύτερος ξενοδοχειακός όμιλος της Μυκόνου και τα πολυτελή ξενοδοχεία-μέλη του ομίλου Myconian Collection, Myconian Imperial Resort, member of the Leading Hotels of the World, Royal Myconian Resort, member of the Leading Hotels of the World, Myconian Villa Collection, member of Preferred Hotels & Resorts, Myconian Avaton Resort, member of Design Hotels, Myconian Utopia Resort, member of Relais & Chateaux, Myconian Ambassador, member of Relais & Chateaux, Panoptis Escape, member of Small Luxury Hotels of the World, O by Myconian Collection επιθυμούν να προσλάβουν: Hotel Restaurant Hostess (2026) Job description Provide a friendly and warm welcome and service to all guests. Presenting/explaining  the restaurant menu Provide sitting assistance by escorting guests to the tables. Handling restaurant reservations  Promoting restaurant in social review sits (Trip Advisor- Google) Daily preparation of reports Demonstrate exceptional guest service, Coperation with all colleagues and department heads Qualifications Previous experience in a similar position within a 5-star property Computer literacy and knowledge of restaurant reservations softwear (i-Host) Fluency in Greek and English, extra languages (German, Italian, French) would be considered a plus. Strong problem-resolution, organizational and multitasking abilities Punctual, well-groomed with strong interpersonal and communication skills Friendly and kind personality, with team spirit Degree in Hospitality/Tourism (desirable) We offer: On-site accommodation and 3 meals Competitive remuneration package Continuous training (Departmental & Generic) under the Leading Quality Standards Excellent working environment Development opportunities within a fast-growing group of luxury 5-star properties', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
(789978, 'Night Auditor - Receptionist - Mykonos', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kq77jsbwz1jtgr550dbncfzq/night-auditor---receptionist---mykonos', 'n/a', '2026-04-27', '2026-04-27 16:01:35', 'MYCONIAN COLLECTION', 'The greatest  hospitality organisation in Mykonos along with its luxury hotel brands: https://www.myconiancollection.gr/ Myconian Imperial Resort, member of the Leading Hotels of the World, Royal Myconian Resort, member of the Leading Hotels of the World, Myconian Villa Collection, member of Preferred Hotels & Resorts, Myconian Avaton Resort, member of Design Hotels, Myconian Utopia Resort, member of Relais & Chateaux, Myconian Ambassador, member of Relais & Chateaux, Panoptis Escape, member of Small Luxury Hotels of the World, Myconian O, by Myconian Collection is seeking to recruit  talented Night Auditor - Receptionist Reports to: Front Office Manager Position description Prompt and efficient completion of all Front Office duties (check-in, check-out, invoicing, call center, guest assistance with requests and complaints, Concierge). Operating the Daily Night Audit Daily preparation of reports Demonstrate exceptional guest service, being proactive in all guests’ requirements and requests, with their prompt and successful resolution. Regularly exceed expectations of Management, guests and associates. Provide a friendly and warm welcome and service to all guests. Friendly and warm cooperation with all colleagues and department heads Follow all relevant Health & Safety department regulations and all guest service guidelines. Maintain the Front Desk and lobby  in a professional order. Qualifications Previous experience of 2 years in a similar position within a 5-star property Computer literacy and knowledge of Hospitality PMS software (Protel) Fluency in Greek and English, extra languages (German, Italian, French) would be considered a plus. Strong problem-resolution, organizational and multitasking abilities Punctual, well-groomed with strong interpersonal and communication skills Friendly and kind personality, with team spirit Degree in Hospitality/Tourism (desirable) We offer: Accommodation and meals Competitive remuneration package Continuous training (Departmental and Generic) Excellent working environment Development opportunities within a fast-growing group of luxury 5-star properties Should you wish to join the Myconian Collection team, please forward us your CV with a recent photo. All applications will be considered confidential.', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
(789979, 'Μάγειρας Γ\' / Cook C', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kq779wzk1adwas8tv41nwyqw/mageiras-g----cook-c', 'n/a', '2026-04-27', '2026-04-27 16:01:37', 'Wavemaker Hospitality', 'Don’t ride the wave. Be the one who starts it. Wavemaker Hospitality, the leading hotel company in Cyprus and Greece, is expanding its operations. We are looking for experienced and talented individuals as Cooks C to join the award-winning 5* Atlantica Holiday Village in Rhodes island for the season 2026. Follow and execute culinary recipes accurately, Work on the presentation and pay attention to the visual appeal of the final product. Collaborate with the Executive Chef to create and update menus, considering seasonal ingredients and customer preferences. Requirements: Minimum of 3 years of experience in a similar position Certificate in culinary arts Strong sense of culinary creativity with attention to detail Ability to multitask in a fast-paced and dynamic environment In-depth knowledge of sanitation principles and food preparation standards Familiarity with a range of baking and other kitchen equipment Excellent communication skills and an enthusiasm for teamwork Benefits: Competitive salary and other benefits (as per local legislation) Advanced opportunities for professional growth Accommodation (if necessary) and board Participation in educational programs Diverse and multicultural environments Professional skills development', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
