rong interpersonal and communication skills Friendly and kind personality, with team spirit Degree in Hospitality/Tourism (desirable) We offer: Accommodation and meals Competitive remuneration package Continuous training (Departmental and Generic) Excellent working environment Development opportunities within a fast-growing group of luxury 5-star properties Should you wish to join the Myconian Collection team, please forward us your CV with a recent photo. All applications will be considered confidential.', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
