e hospitality sector. Knowledge of security procedures, emergency response, and safety regulations. Ability to remain calm and act decisively in emergency situations. Good communication skills and ability to interact professionally with guests and colleagues. Certification in First Aid and CPR is a plus. Fluency in Greek and English; additional languages are advantageous. Strong sense of responsibility, integrity, and attention to detail. Physical fitness and ability to conduct patrols and stand for extended periods. Benefits: At Conrad Athens The Ilisian, you’ll be part of a world-renowned luxury brand where creativity, collaboration, and the pursuit of excellence are celebrated. We are committed to nurturing our Team Members’ professional growth and well-being (offering a unique opportunity to contribute to the legacy of a landmark property in the vibrant city of Athens). The Company offers a competitive remuneration package, private medical insurance, and career development opportunities in a dynamically growing business environment.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
