ith cleaning and organizing supplies. Uphold the hotel’s service standards while ensuring attention to detail in all tasks performed. Engage with guests positively and assist with any inquiries they may have. Απαιτήσεις/Requirements: Τουλάχιστον 2 χρόνια προϋπηρεσίας σε θέση οροφοκομίας ή houseman, κατά προτίμηση σε ξενοδοχείο ή χώρο φιλοξενίας. Iσχυρή προσοχή στη λεπτομέρεια και αφοσίωση στη διατήρηση υψηλών προτύπων καθαριότητας. Ικανότητα συνεργασίας με διαφορετικές ομάδες και υποστήριξης άλλων τμημάτων, όταν χρειάζεται. Εξαιρετικές επικοινωνιακές δεξιότητες στα Ελληνικά και στα Αγγλικά· η γνώση επιπλέον γλωσσών θεωρείται πλεονέκτημα. Ικανότητα ιεράρχησης καθηκόντων και αποτελεσματικής διαχείρισης χρόνου σε ένα απαιτητικό περιβάλλον. Καλή φυσική κατάσταση για την εκτέλεση διαφόρων εργασιών που περιλαμβάνουν ανύψωση, μετακίνηση και καθαρισμό. Θετική και φιλική συμπεριφορά με έντονο προσανατολισμό στην εξυπηρέτηση των επισκεπτών. Minimum of 2 years\' experience in a housekeeping or houseman role, preferably in a hotel or hospitality setting. Strong attention to detail and a dedication to maintaining high cleanliness standards. Ability to work collaboratively with diverse teams and support other departments as needed. Excellent communication skills in both Greek and English; additional languages are a plus. Ability to prioritize tasks and manage time effectively in a busy environment. Physical stamina to perform various lifting, moving, and cleaning tasks as required. Positive and friendly demeanor with a strong guest service orientation. Παροχές/Benefits: Στο Conrad Athens The Ilisian, θα είσαι μέλος ενός παγκοσμίου φήμης brand πολυτελείας, όπου η δημιουργικότητα, η συνεργασία και η επιδίωξη της αριστείας είναι βασικές αξίες. Δεσμευόμαστε να στηρίζουμε την επαγγελματική εξέλιξη και ευημερία των μελών της ομάδας μας, προσφέροντας μια μοναδική ευκαιρία να συμβάλεις στην κληρονομιά ενός ξεχωριστού ξενοδοχείου στην καρδιά της σύγχρονης Αθήνας. Η εταιρεία προσφέρει ανταγωνιστικό πακέτο αποδοχών, ιδιωτική ιατρική ασφάλιση και ευκαιρίες επαγγελματικής εξέλιξης σε ένα περιβάλλον συνεχούς ανάπτυξης. At Conrad Athens The Ilisian, you’ll be part of a world-renowned luxury brand where creativity, collaboration, and the pursuit of excellence are celebrated. We are committed to nurturing our Team Members’ professional growth and well-being (offering a unique opportunity to contribute to the legacy of a landmark property in the vibrant city of Athens). The Company offers a competitive remuneration package, private medical insurance, and career development opportunities in a dynamically growing business environment.', 'Με φυσική παρουσία'),
(796676, 'In Room Dining Waiter/Waitress | Conrad Athens the Ilisian', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kr1h2z93d1p5f742977fjrs5/in-room-dining-waiter-waitress-', 'n/a', '2026-05-07', '2026-05-07 16:00:45', 'Conrad Athens The Ilisian', 'In Room Dining Waiter/Waitress Description Be part of the newest luxury hotel, Conrad Athens The Ilisian. Located within The Ilisian - the new multidimensional city destination of Athens, this new luxury hotel marks a new chapter in Athenian hospitality offering an unparalleled experience in the city\'s vibrant cultural and historical center. As an In Room Dining Waiter/Waitress at Conrad Athens The Ilisian, you will provide exceptional dining experiences for guests in the comfort of their accommodations. Your role is vital in ensuring that room service maintains the same high standards of quality and service that our guests expect throughout the hotel. You will be responsible for delivering food and beverages, setting up trays, and creating a memorable in-room dining experience. Responsibilities Respond promptly and accurately to in-room dining orders, ensuring meticulous attention to detail and guest preferences. Deliver food and beverages to guest rooms with professionalism, maintaining a courteous, friendly, and polished demeanor at all times. Set up dining trays or tables as requested, ensuring a clean, well-organized, and aesthetically pleasing presentation of all items. Promptly clear used trays, dishes, and utensils, maintaining cleanliness and order in both guest areas and service stations. Present menus and offer informed recommendations, effectively communicating daily specials and accommodating guest preferences. Address guest inquiries and special requests efficiently, ensuring comfort, satisfaction, and a seamless dining experience. Coordinate closely with kitchen staff to ensure timely meal preparation, accurate order fulfillment, and proper handling of dietary restrictions. Maintain strict adherence to health, hygiene, and safety standards, in compliance with hotel protocols and regulatory requirements. Requirements Minimum of 2 years of experience in a similar role within a luxury hotel or upscale dining environment. Strong customer service skills with an emphasis on personalized in-room dining experiences. Excellent communication skills in both Greek and English; knowledge of additional languages is a plus. Excellent communication skills and confidence in handling phone orders. Ability to work independently and efficiently in a fast-paced environment. Knowledge of food safety standards and proper handling of culinary items. Detail-oriented with a focus on presentation and overall guest satisfaction. Flexibility to work various shifts, including evenings and weekends. Benefits: At Conrad Athens The Ilisian, you’ll be part of a world-renowned luxury brand where creativity, collaboration, and the pursuit of excellence are celebrated. We are committed to nurturing our Team Members’ professional growth and well-being (offering a unique opportunity to contribute to the legacy of a landmark property in the vibrant city of Athens). The Company offers a competitive remuneration package, private medical insurance, and career development opportunities in a dynamically growing business environment.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(796677, 'Casual Waiter/ Waitress | Conrad Athens the Ilisian', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kr1h3ebca4njkktagc99tnm4/casual-waiter--waitress-', 'n/a', '2026-05-07', '2026-05-07 16:00:45', 'Conrad Athens The Ilisian', 'Casual Waiter/Waitress Be part of the newest luxury hotel, Conrad Athens The Ilisian. Located within The Ilisian - the new multidimensional city destination of Athens, this new luxury hotel marks a new chapter in Athenian hospitality offering an unparalleled experience in the city\'s vibrant cultural and historical center. As a Casual Waiter/Waitress at Conrad Athens The Ilisian, you will play a vital role in delivering exceptional dining experiences to our guests in a relaxed and inviting atmosphere. Your responsibilities will include providing support to the waitstaff, ensuring timely service, and maintaining a pleasant environment for guests. This position is perfect for individuals seeking flexible hours while being part of a passionate and dedicated team. Responsibilities Handle high-volume service calmly and efficiently Able to adjust quickly and flexibly to new tasks assigned Attention to detail during setup (alignment, cleanliness, symmetry, consistency) Welcome and greet guests, take their orders, and provide menu suggestions based on their preferences. Maintain cleanliness and order in dining areas, ensuring tables are set properly for new guests. Help in clearing used plates and utensils from tables promptly while ensuring guest satisfaction. Address guest inquiries and requests with enthusiasm, ensuring a pleasant dining experience. Participate in training sessions to enhance service skills and knowledge of menu offerings. Follow all health and safety guidelines to maintain a safe dining environment for guests and staff. Requirements Minimum of 2 years of experience in a similar role within the hospitality industry is preferred but not mandatory. Strong customer service orientation with a positive attitude towards guest interactions. Ability to communicate effectively in both Greek and English; knowledge of additional languages is a bonus. Self-motivated with the ability to work well in a team and under pressure. Professional appearance and behavior. Confident but discreet presence. Able to follow instructions from supervisors and work cooperatively with colleagues. Must possess physical stamina for long hours and lifting/setup tasks. The casual waiters will be engaged on a non‑permanent basis and will be scheduled strictly on an on‑call arrangement, according to operational needs Flexible availability, including weekends and holidays, to accommodate varying business needs. Willingness to learn and adapt to new dining styles and service standards. Benefits: At Conrad Athens The Ilisian, you’ll be part of a world-renowned luxury brand where creativity, collaboration, and the pursuit of excellence are celebrated. We are committed to nurturing our Team Members’ professional growth and well-being (offering a unique opportunity to contribute to the legacy of a landmark property in the vibrant city of Athens). The Company offers a competitive remuneration package, private medical insurance, and career development opportunities in a dynamically growing business environment.', 'Με φυσική παρουσία'),
(796678, 'Creative Designer', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kr1eb64ngw5d5ck2fzn9n1ah/creative-designer', 'n/a', '2026-05-07', '2026-05-07 16:00:47', 'SANDBLU', 'Sandblu Resort is currently in search of: Creative Designer  Sandblu: Shaping a new era of ultra-luxury hospitality in Santorini Perched on the foothills of Ancient Thira, Sandblu redefines world-class luxury on the island of Santorini. Since first opening its doors in 2024, the resort has earned recognition among hundreds of guests 5-star reviews but also prestigious Media including Vogue, Travel & Leisure, Condé Nast Traveler, The Times, Robb Report and more. In 2025, we proudly launched Blu Restaurant in Imerovigli, extending the Caldera Experience, and received “Greece’s Best Hotel Restaurant 2025” award for Nectar at the World Culinary Awards. With 66 exquisitely designed accommodation options, multiple exceptional dining venues, Aurora Spa, Nous & Soma Fitness Center, a kids’ club, several retail boutiques, a chapel and multi-purpose areas for bespoke events, Sandblu offers a complete, full-service 5-star resort experience, in a Cycladic village setting. From wellness retreats to one-of-a-kind in-house experiences for guests, every moment spent here is thoughtfully curated and made to be remembered. As a fast-growing, award-winning company with headquarters in Athens, Sandblu partners with leading consortia, participates in international trade shows and fairs, and innovates towards a vision for building microcosm of extraordinary experiences across Santorini, with respect to the heritage and the local community. With a growth mindset and a commitment to excellence and constant improvement, Sandblu offers it all. It’s a flagship destination where every detail is intentional, and every guest journey unforgettable. Discover more: Sandblu Restaurant Gallery, Nectar Restaurant Gallery and Blu Restaurant Gallery or find us on social media at Sandblu, Nectar Restaurant and Blu Restaurant. Job requirements:  Education in Graphic Design, Visual Communication or Brand Managemen Proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite, along with additional design tools including Canva, Figma, Adobe Express, Procreate, or AI-powered creative platforms  Experience in luxury, hospitality, fashion or lifestyle-focused projects A strong portfolio demonstrating exceptional creativity, artistic direction capabilities, and executional excellence Ability to own projects end-to-end, from idea to delivery  Strong conceptual thinking with a hands-on approach  Refined aesthetic sensibility and high attention to detail  Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment Strong communication and collaboration skills Job responsibilities:  Oversee all Sandblu creative projects, from concept to execution, in alignment with the Brand Marketing Strategy and the resort’s goals Translate marketing briefs into fresh creative concepts and deliverables Work autonomously in a fast-paced environment with deadlines, managing multiple projects simultaneously with the same attention to detail Develop and design a wide range of assets, including:  Logo applications and brand elements  Marketing collaterals(brochures, presentations, decks etc)  Menus, invitations, and on-property materials  Campaign visuals and advertising assets  Website, social media and digital content  Ad hoc design needs for special events, press and fam trips, retreats, weddings and more Bring creative input and fresh conceptual thinking into every project the marketing team runs. Maintain and organize creative libraries, brand assets and physical archives Lead and oversee print production specifications, ensuring premium quality output. Curate materials, finishes, and formats in line with a luxury aesthetic Oversee all design elements across touchpoints, ensuring a cohesive brand presence. Collaborate with internal departments to understand their needs and deliver tailored creative solutions and materials on-time. Work closely with Marketing to ensure all output is aligned with the overall brand concept and strategy. Maintain and evolve the resort’s brand guidelines Job benefits:  Tailored Compensation: Salary package customized to fairly reflect your profile and expertise. Exclusive Staff Privileges: Access to special staff discounts across our network of partners and Friends & Family rates for your loved ones. Pathway to Growth & Development: Ongoing professional development in line with global hospitality standards and a clear trajectory for career advancement within a fast-growing, award-winning resort. Recognition & Rewards: Access to performance-based bonus schemes and recognition initiatives that celebrate talent, achievement, and contribution to the Sandblu vision, along with CSR and engagement activities that foster connection and purpose. Passion, precision, purpose – make this your own career story.   We are a team of passionate, creative professionals delivering heartfelt hospitality, where precision, warmth, and artistry define every interaction. We nurture growth, celebrate individuality, and empower our team to thrive in a culture built on collaboration and shared purpose. Your Worklife at Sandblu: Warmth & Unforgettable Hospitality | Teamwork & Positive Energy | Kindness, Empathy, Integrity | Continuous Improvement | Learning Something New Every Day. At Sandblu, our teams are at the heart of every guest experience, embodying the spirit and values of our brand, as true ambassadors. Every element of the employee experience reflects the same attention to detail we offer to our guests. We are actively committed to their well-being, from modern accommodations and nutritious meals to a balanced, fulfilling and friendly work environment, where respect is protected. We open pathways for their growth and recognize their contributions, empowering them with every tool to make an impact at their job from day one, so they can bring their best selves to work every day.  If you are driven to create extraordinary experiences and make an impact from day one, click on the \"Application\" tab to Apply! RMKA PC and RSTQ PC are equal opportunity employers. We are committed to creating a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, or age. ', 'Εποχιακή εργασία'),
(796679, 'Account Manager (POS) - Nexi', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kr1ek440ysad206j9km9yjt5/field-sales-representative---nexi---enarxi-martios', 'n/a', '2026-05-07', '2026-05-07 16:00:47', 'CQS ΑΕ', 'Η CQS διακρίθηκε ξανά! Στη φετινή κατάταξη Top Employers 2025 του WhereWeWork.com, βάσει των αξιολογήσεων των ανθρώπων μας, πετύχαμε: 🏆 1η θέση στον κλάδο BPO & Services 🌟 2η θέση στη συνολική κατάταξη Top 50 στην Ελλάδα Γίνε κι εσύ μέλος μιας ομάδας που ξεχωρίζει για το εργασιακό της περιβάλλον! Η CQS S.A., με περισσότερους από 2200+ εργαζόμενους, αποτελεί ηγετική δύναμη στον χώρο της διαχείρισης πελατειακών σχέσεων και συνεργάζεται με κορυφαίες ελληνικές και πολυεθνικές εταιρείες στους τομείς Τηλεπικοινωνιών, Ενέργειας, Λιανικής, Τραπεζών και Ασφάλισης. Στόχος μας είναι η παροχή υψηλής ποιότητας υπηρεσιών που ενισχύουν τη θετική εμπειρία των πελατών μας, ενώ ταυτόχρονα προσφέρουμε στους ανθρώπους μας ευκαιρίες εξέλιξης και ανάπτυξης καριέρας. Για λογαριασμό της Nexi, κορυφαίας εταιρείας στον χώρο των ηλεκτρονικών πληρωμών, αναζητούμε ενεργά άτομα για τον ρόλο του Account Manager, που θα συμβάλουν στην ανάπτυξη του δικτύου συνεργασιών και στην προώθηση λύσεων ηλεκτρονικών πληρωμών στην ελληνική αγορά. Σχετικά με τον μελλοντικό σου ρόλο : Είσαι επικοινωνιακός, δραστήριος και έτοιμος να ξεκινήσεις την καριέρα σου στον κόσμο των ψηφιακών πληρωμών; Γίνε μέλος της αναπτυσσόμενης ομάδας πωλήσεών μας, στην Αθήνα και μπες δυναμικά σε έναν από τους ταχύτερα εξελισσόμενους κλάδους της αγοράς! Ως Account Manager, θα βρίσκεσαι στην “πρώτη γραμμή”, θα επισκέπτεσαι επιχειρήσεις και επαγγελματίες, παρουσιάζοντας σύγχρονες λύσεις αποδοχής καρτών και ηλεκτρονικών πληρωμών. Θα μάθεις από κοντά πώς λειτουργεί ο χώρος των πληρωμών και θα χτίσεις γερά θεμέλια για την επαγγελματική σου εξέλιξη. 🔑 Περιγραφή ρόλου: Επισκέπτεσαι τοπικές επιχειρήσεις για να παρουσιάσεις λύσεις αποδοχής καρτών (POS & E-commerce). Δημιουργείς και διατηρείς σχέσεις εμπιστοσύνης με εμπόρους και επαγγελματίες. Συμμετέχεις ενεργά στη διαδικασία πώλησης — από την αναζήτηση πελατών μέχρι την ενεργοποίηση της υπηρεσίας. Παρέχεις βασική υποστήριξη στους πελάτες μετά την πώληση. Επίτευξη στόχων πωλήσεων και ανάπτυξη πελατολογίου. Αναφέρεις αποτελέσματα και ανατροφοδότηση από την αγορά στην ομάδα σου 🎯 Τι αναζητούμε: 1–3 χρόνια εμπειρίας σε πωλήσεις (εμπειρία σε door-to-door ή B2B πωλήσεις θα θεωρηθεί πλεονέκτημα). Επικοινωνιακές δεξιότητες, θετική στάση και διάθεση για μάθηση. Προσανατολισμό στον στόχο και ικανότητα να εργάζεσαι αυτόνομα και ομαδικά. Οργανωτικότητα, υπευθυνότητα και επιμονή. Δίπλωμα οδήγησης 🌟 Τι προσφέρουμε: Ανταγωνιστικό σταθερό μισθό και Bonus βάσει επίτευξης στόχων Πλήρη εκπαίδευση και υποστήριξη από έμπειρη ομάδα πωλήσεων. Προοπτική εξέλιξης σε ένα δυναμικό περιβάλλον Εταιρικό αυτοκίνητο και καύσιμα κίνησης Σύγχρονα εργαλεία για να κάνεις αποτελεσματικά τη δουλειά σου. 🚀 Γιατί να μας επιλέξεις Αν έχεις πάθος για τις πωλήσεις, σου αρέσει να έρχεσαι σε επαφή με ανθρώπους και θέλεις να χτίσεις καριέρα σε έναν σύγχρονο και αναπτυσσόμενο κλάδο, αυτή είναι η ευκαιρία σου! Μπες σε έναν κόσμο γεμάτο προοπτικές, γνώση και δυναμική εξέλιξη — κι εμείς θα είμαστε δίπλα σου σε κάθε βήμα.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
