(798701, 'Senior Consultants / Consultants', 'https://www.skywalker.gr/el/aggelia-ergasias/01kr8hnh37dgf2hyj733nkynvy/senior-consultants---consultants', 'n/a', '2026-05-10', '2026-05-10 16:00:45', 'Senior Consultants / Consultants', 'We are a Greek leading consulting firm, providing advisory and consulting services in branded customers in Greece, Europe and Middle East. Our company is looking for Senior Consultants and Consultants to join its Governance, Risk and Compliance consulting team, on a full-time employment basis. Work includes the provision of consulting services (i.e. gap analysis, assessments, management systems implementations and project management) in the areas of GRC (as of ISO9001, ISO14001, ISO45001, ISO50001 etc) and/or in the areas of Risk Management (as ISO27001, ISO27701, ISO22301, ISO31000, ISO42001, DORA, NIS2 etc) and/or in the area of Project Management (on consulting / services projects). Relevant degrees and/or certifications are required per field of knowledge. The ideal candidates at Senior Level must have an expertise / experience at least 3 years in the areas of their competence (including gap analysis, assessments, management systems implementations and Project Management) while for standard level, an 1-year experience is considered acceptable. Skills and competencies also include  University (or equivalent) degree as a must Excellent English Language (read/write/speak) competence  Good communication and organizational skills  Ability to work independently as well as part of a team  Self-motivated and results oriented  Friendly and positive thinking Relevant professional certifications will be considered mandatory We offer a highly motivated environment, providing field knowledge through on-going training and certification, creating expertise through projects and supporting career development, company insurance and other benefits. Hybrid work is part of our current policy. We treat all applications as strictly confidential and in accordance with our GDPR policy, we will retain the information included in applications submitted for no longer than 3 months from the date of submission.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
